preset-ice-level-list-title = Will the water level change when the ice melts?
preset-ice-level-list-question = We drop an ice cube into a measuring cylinder of water — it will float. We note the level, wait for the ice to melt and read the marks again. How will the water level change when the ice melts?
preset-ice-level-list-choices = It will rise
preset-ice-level-list-choices-2 = It will drop
preset-ice-level-list-choices-3 = It will stay the same
